## How long to wait
## duration in s, 1s-5m, required
timeout: 30

## duration, <= 2s, required
hold-ms: 250

## size in MB, KB to TB in powers of 1000, <= 2GB
# cache: 512MB

## size, required
chunk: 64KiB

